Year = {2016},
Pages = {22-27},
Abstract = {This chapter will describe one supervised algorithm that is frequently
   used to predict the function of proteins, the quantitative
   structure-activity relationship model (QSAR). I will discuss its
   advantages and disadvantages, and I will present a model called the
   polarity index method. This model shows a high degree of efficiency in
   predicting the main function of peptides and proteins by inspecting the
   linear sequence of macromolecules to evaluate a single physico-chemical
   property, polarity.},
