Month = {OCT},
Abstract = {In this work the super free fall motion of the interface of a liquid
   column flowing downwards, suddenly from the rest in a system of vertical
   concentrically interconnected tubes, is studied theoretically, using a
   one-dimensional model in the inviscid regime. The ratio of the surface
   area of the upper tube to that of the lower one, A(1)/A(2), is assumed
   to be smaller than unity. Experiments show a good agreement with the
   main results of the developed theory. Copyright (C) EPLA, 2015},
