Abstract = {This paper reports results of CMOS sensor suitable for use as charged
   particles and ionizing radiation detector. The CMOS sensor with 640x480
   pixels area has been integrated into an electronic circuit for detection
   of ionizing radiation and it was exposed to alpha particle (Am-241,
   U-nat), beta (Sr-90), and gamma photons (Cs-137). Results show after
   long period of time (168 h) irradiation the sensor had not loss of
   functionality and also the energy of the charge particles and photons
   were very well obtained.},
