Number = {2},
Pages = {91-100},
Month = {OCT},
Abstract = {A new subgenus Neotomobia n. subg. (Acariformes: Myobiidae: Radfordia)
   is established for species parasitising rodents of the subfamily
   Neotominae (Rodentia: Cricetidae): Radfordia subuliger Ewing, 1938
   (type-species), Radfordia eremici Fain \& Bochkov, 2002, Radfordia
   neotomae Jameson \& Whitaker, 1975 and Radfordia hamiltoni Jameson \&
   Whitaker, 1975. Three new species are described: Radfordia peromyscus n.
   sp. from Peromyscus megalops Merriam from Mexico, Radfordia onychomys n.
   sp. from Onychomys leucogaster (Wied-Neuwied) from the USA and Radfordia
   megadontomys n. sp. from Megadontomys thomasi (Merriam) from Mexico.},
